Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: install profile packages of the console's winget
 repository from it

Profile tasks that install or uninstall a winget package always used
winget's community repository. Packages uploaded to the console's
private winget repository (Deploy > Software library, see the related
openuem-console PR) are in the software package catalog with the source
"openuem". For those, the WinGet configuration now uses the source
"OpenUEM", the name under which the agents register the repository, so
profiles can deploy them to all their computers.

